I would like to clarify this statement a bit:

the announcement of LaTeX2e says that releases are distributed twice a year
on fixed dates (spring/fall distribution).

this does not mean that

a) during this test release we will not  correct bugs and distribute them
   asap

b) that major bugs in the real implementation will only be fixed every
   have year. We will probably provide patches in such case but let's
   hope that we have found most bugs soon :-)


